| IR-5 | Incident Monitoring | Continuous, correlated | - | A.16.1.5 | Monitoring dashboard, correlation rules, threat intel | UEBA, threat intel integration, attack path analysis |
| IR-6 | Incident Reporting | Automated, stakeholder | - | A.16.1.6 | Report templates, automation, comms log | Automated reports, executive dashboards, regulatory |
| PM-14 | Testing/Training/Evaluation | Red team, purple team, chaos | - | A.12.6.1 | Test plans, results, improvement actions | Red team, chaos engineering, policy simulation |

