## Evidence Collection Guide

### Per Control Evidence Package
```
evidence/
├── CM-8/
│   ├── cmdb-export-YYYYMMDD.csv
│   ├── discovery-scan-results.json
│   ├── reconciliation-report.pdf
│   └── classification-tags.yaml
├── SC-7/
│   ├── network-diagram.drawio
│   ├── firewall-rules-export.json
│   ├── microseg-test-results.pdf
│   └── ztna-config.yaml
├── IA-2/
│   ├── mfa-enrollment-report.csv
│   ├── fido2-deployment-status.pdf
│   ├── conditional-access-policies.json
│   └── auth-logs-sample.json
└── SI-4/
    ├── edr-deployment-report.pdf
    ├── ueba-model-metrics.json
    ├── soar-playbook-list.yaml
    └── mttd-mttr-metrics.csv
```

### Evidence Automation
- **Continuous**: API pulls from tools (SIEM, CSPM, MDM, IdP)
- **Scheduled**: Weekly config exports, monthly scan results
- **On-Demand**: Auditor requests, incident evidence
- **Format**: JSON (machine-readable) + PDF (human-readable)
- **Integrity**: Signed, timestamped, stored in WORM storage

